      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MY MONROE (3) found trouble in the run here last time and failed to finish. No luck latest and worth another chance. ZIPPING SCHRUB (7) goes very well this trip starting 26 times for 13 wins and five minors. Below best last time at Capalaba (19.72) in a OPEN, finishing a 2.25 lengths fourth. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. DASHING MIMCO (1) failed to feature last start after missing the jump at this track, but prior to that won by one length at this track (22.68) beating Aussie Oscar in a Free For All on October 2. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Better than last start and can bounce back. LOCHINVAR GRACE (5) is always a threat when she races at this journey.",
